OL,3,AWoman, 65, becomes second patient to
OL,4,Adie of Ebola in Kenya
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenya has recorded its second death
OL,7,Ffrom Ebola as it handles its first ever
OL,8,Foutbreak of the disease.
OL,10,FA woman, aged 65, who was a close
OL,11,Ffamily member of the first victim, a
OL,12,Fman who had travelled from the
OL,13,FDemocratic Republic of Congo, died
OL,14,Fafter being placed in quarantine, the
OL,15,Fhealth ministry said.
OL,17,FSeven other Ebola patients were
OL,18,Freceiving treatment at two isolation
OL,19,Ffacilities, it added.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
